  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name="Where Should Olist Grow Next?"><style/><size maxheight="900" maxwidth="1200" minheight="900" minwidth="1200" sizing-mode="fixed"/><zones><zone id="0" x="0" y="0" w="100000" h="100000" type-v2="layout-basic"><zone id="1" x="1333" y="1333" w="73333" h="4667" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="22" bold="true" fontcolor="#303b42">Where Should Olist Grow Next?</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="2" x="1333" y="6000" w="97333" h="3000" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="10" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">Brazilian marketplace orders | Historical analysis, 2017-2018 | Liang Yao</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="3" x="1333" y="9556" w="97333" h="10000" name="KPI Overview" show-title="false"/><zone id="4" x="1333" y="20556" w="70000" h="38889" name="State Opportunity Ranking"/><zone id="5" x="1333" y="60556" w="70000" h="31667" name="Market Scale vs Delivery Risk"/><zone id="6" x="73333" y="20556" w="25000" h="16444" name="State Opportunity Ranking" type-v2="color" param="[federated.1u2efw001eayuc1b26b3f1cvisw0].[none:recommendation:nk]" pane-specification-id="0"/><zone id="7" x="73333" y="38000" w="25000" h="28889" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="11" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">RECOMMENDED ACTIONS

SP: Defend the core market.

PR and MG: Validate expansion.

RJ and BA: Improve delivery and customer experience before scaling.

DF: Start with a small pilot.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="8" x="73333" y="68000" w="25000" h="23667" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="10" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">READ THE SCORE WITH CARE

Weights express priorities, not expected profit.

Seller location is a coverage proxy, not capacity.

Low-volume states need more evidence before a large commitment.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="9" x="1333" y="93000" w="97333" h="6222" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="9" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">KPI scope: Jan 2017-Aug 2018; delivered orders with actual delivery dates. State scope: Jan-Aug 2017 vs Jan-Aug 2018; 16 states with at least 500 orders. Product value excludes freight and is not Olist platform revenue.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone></zone></zones><simple-id uuid="{DC17C136-97A9-5886-B6E4-5B2D3B8790A6}"/></dashboard><dashboard name="Growth &amp; Customer Experience"><style/><size maxheight="900" maxwidth="1200" minheight="900" minwidth="1200" sizing-mode="fixed"/><zones><zone id="0" x="0" y="0" w="100000" h="100000" type-v2="layout-basic"><zone id="1" x="1333" y="1333" w="97333" h="4667" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="22" bold="true" fontcolor="#303b42">Growth &amp; Customer Experience</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="2" x="1333" y="6000" w="97333" h="3333" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="11" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">Demand grew, but growth alone does not establish where expansion will pay off.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="3" x="1333" y="10667" w="23333" h="7556" type-v2="paramctrl" param="[Parameters].[Trend Metric]"/><zone id="4" x="26333" y="10667" w="15000" h="7556" type-v2="paramctrl" param="[Parameters].[Trend Year]"/><zone id="5" x="1333" y="19444" w="97333" h="28889" name="Monthly Delivered Orders and Product Value"/><zone id="6" x="1333" y="49889" w="60417" h="36222" name="Top 10 Categories by Product Value"/><zone id="7" x="63833" y="49889" w="34833" h="20556" name="Late Delivery and Negative Reviews"/><zone id="8" x="63833" y="71111" w="34833" h="15000" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="11" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">53.98% of reviewed late orders had a negative review, versus 9.17% of on-time orders.

This association supports investigation; it does not prove that lateness caused the difference.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone><zone id="9" x="1333" y="88444" w="97333" h="10556" type-v2="text"><formatted-text><run fontname="Arial" fontsize="9" bold="false" fontcolor="#303b42">Monthly trend: all delivered orders purchased Jan 2017-Aug 2018 (96,211 orders; includes 8 missing delivery dates). Category comparison: Jan-Aug in each year; an order can belong to several categories. Reviews: delivered orders with actual delivery dates and matched reviews; negative = mean order review score &lt;= 2. Rates use their own denominators.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr="margin" value="6"/></zone-style></zone></zone></zones><simple-id uuid="{8D17A48F-E650-5282-B3C8-DA544A20E5BC}"/></dashboard></dashboards>
